\"site-header__link\">FAQ</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"#call_to_action\" class=\"button button--primary button--small\">Start Building</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<section id=\"component_hero_1\" class=\"section section--hero\">\n  <div class=\"container hero\">\n    <h1 class=\"hero__title\">Orchestrate Complex AI Workflows Without Building Infrastructure</h1>\n    <p class=\"hero__subtitle\">Deploy multi-agent systems that work together seamlessly. From instant websites to intelligent content pipelines—set it up with simple instructions, no coding required.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero__actions\">\n      <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"button button--primary button--large\">Explore Plans</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\" class=\"button button--secondary button--large\">See How It Works</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_social_proof_2\" class=\"section section--social-proof\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"stat-highlight\">\n      <div class=\"stat-highlight__number\">10,000+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-highlight__label\">Workflows Deployed This Quarter</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testimonials grid grid--3\">\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"We went from months of custom development to a live, multi-agent workflow in days. The human-in-the-loop controls gave us exactly the oversight we needed.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">Future Agency Director</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"The pay-per-use model means we only pay for what we use. Scaling from 5 sites to 500 sites didn't require renegotiating contracts or upgrading infrastructure.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">Soon-to-be Delighted Operations Lead</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"Our team isn't technical, but the no-code setup made it possible for us to orchestrate sophisticated content workflows. It just works.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">Emerging Growth-Stage Founder</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_features_3\" class=\"section section--features\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h2 class=\"section__title section__title--center\">What You Can Build</h2>\n    <div class=\"features grid grid--4\">\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🌐</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Instant Websites</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Generate fully functional websites from just a domain name. Intelligent component assembly handles the rest.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">✍️</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Content at Scale</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Deploy proven persuasion models like AIDA, PAS, and Cialdini principles across thousands of pieces simultaneously.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🔄</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Multi-Agent Coordination</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Specialized AI agents work in parallel, orchestrated to handle complex workflows with human oversight at key decision points.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🚀</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Instant Deployment</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Automated deployment to live hosting. Your workflows are production-ready without manual configuration.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_pricing_4\" class=\"section section--pricing\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n  