nly pay for what we use. Scaling from 5 sites to 500 sites didn't require renegotiating contracts or upgrading infrastructure.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">Soon-to-be Delighted Operations Lead</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial card\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial__rating\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__text\">\"Our team isn't technical, but the no-code setup made it possible for us to orchestrate sophisticated content workflows. It just works.\"</p>\n        <p class=\"testimonial__author\">Emerging Growth-Stage Founder</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_features_3\" class=\"section section--features\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h2 class=\"section__title section__title--center\">What You Can Build</h2>\n    <div class=\"features grid grid--4\">\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🌐</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Instant Websites</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Generate fully functional websites from just a domain name. Intelligent component assembly handles the rest.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">✍️</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Content at Scale</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Deploy proven persuasion models like AIDA, PAS, and Cialdini principles across thousands of pieces simultaneously.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🔄</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Multi-Agent Coordination</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Specialized AI agents work in parallel, orchestrated to handle complex workflows with human oversight at key decision points.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature__icon\">🚀</div>\n        <h3 class=\"feature__title\">Instant Deployment</h3>\n        <p class=\"feature__description\">Automated deployment to live hosting. Your workflows are production-ready without manual configuration.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_pricing_4\" class=\"section section--pricing\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h2 class=\"section__title section__title--center\">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h2>\n    <div class=\"pricing-tiers grid grid--3\">\n      <div class=\"pricing-tier card\">\n        <h3 class=\"pricing-tier__name\">Starter</h3>\n        <div class=\"pricing-tier__price\">$99<span style=\"font-size: 0.5em; color: #999;\">/mo</span></div>\n        <ul class=\"pricing-tier__features\">\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Up to 10 custom workflows</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Basic agent library access</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Email support</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"button button--secondary button--full-width\">Get Started</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-tier pricing-tier--featured card\">\n        <div class=\"pricing-tier__badge\">Popular</div>\n        <h3 class=\"pricing-tier__name\">Professional</h3>\n        <div class=\"pricing-tier__price\">$299<span style=\"font-size: 0.5em; color: #999;\">/mo</span></div>\n        <ul class=\"pricing-tier__features\">\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Unlimited custom workflows</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Full component library + custom builds</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Priority support & strategy guidance</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Advanced analytics & reporting</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"button button--primary button--full-width\">Start Free Trial</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-tier card\">\n        <h3 class=\"pricing-tier__name\">Enterprise</h3>\n        <div class=\"pricing-tier__price\">Custom</div>\n        <ul class=\"pricing-tier__features\">\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Everything in Professional</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Dedicated orchestration engineer</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">24/7 phone & priority support</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">Custom agent development</li>\n          <li class=\"pricing-tier__feature\">SLA & compliance support</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"button button--secondary button--full-width\">Contact Sales</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"component_faq_5\" class=\"section section--faq\">\n  <div class=\"container container--narrow\">\n    <h2 class=\"section__title section__title--center\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-item__question\">How do I set up my first workflow?</summary>\n        <p class=\"faq-item__answer\">We handle the setup for you. Simply tell us your objectives—whether that's creating websites, building content pipelines, or automating data processing—and we configure your custom agent workflow. You manage it through our no-code interface with human-in-the-loop controls at key decision points.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-item__question\">What if I need to scale from 10 workflows to 1,000?</summary>\n        <p class=\"faq-item__answer\">That's exactly what we're built for. Our pay-per-use model means you only pay for what you deploy. Scaling doesn't require infrastructure changes or renegotiation—just deploy more agents and let the orchestration layer handle coordination.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-item__question\">Do I need technical expertise?</summary>\n        <p class=\"faq-item__answer\">No. The framework is designed for non-technical teams. You configure workflows through simple instructions, 